<http://data.silknow.org/object/5073295d-ee63-3ff3-b278-8d255a3b90d8>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Central feature in design is a large basket filled with naturalistic roses and leafy plants. Above this is an alphabet. Flanking it are various short horizontal vine motives. Beneath it is a row of geometric motives then, various vegetative, animal and insect motives, and a small landscape scene. Near the center is a small wreath with the initials ‘N D' and the date 18--. Border of green cotton tape. Couched repairs to ground; missing yarns. Lined. Stitiches: cross, rococo, tent, and two-side Italian cross variations"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/60aabe31-649a-3612-8dc5-8fbaf2e4b50b> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Central feature in design is a large basket filled with naturalistic roses and leafy plants. Above this is an alphabet. Flanking it are various short horizontal vine motives. Beneath it is a row of geometric motives then, various vegetative, animal and insect motives, and a small landscape scene. Near the center is a small wreath with the initials ‘N D' and the date 18--. Border of green cotton tape. Couched repairs to ground; missing yarns. Lined. Stitiches: cross, rococo, tent, and two-side Italian cross variations"@en ;
